{"id":"vod_bf_40866","vodId":"40866","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"学园孤岛","name_cn":"学园孤岛","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/ba022046cebeddfa9e78ffa8eecb627f.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在巡之丘学园中，丈枪由纪（水濑祈 配音）天真可爱，是名副其实的开心果。惠飞须泽胡桃（小泽亚李 配音）踏实可靠，她的坚强和元气影响了身边的每一个人。若狭悠里（市道真央 配音）温柔坚强，是大家心目中稳重的靠山。直树美纪（高桥李依 配音）外表冷漠，但内心的热情不容忽视。这些可爱的孩子们共同组成了“学园生活部”，每天都在进行愉快的部活。　　空无一人的校园，破败不堪的教室，四处游走的行尸，究竟哪一个是幻想，哪一个是真实？巨大的灾难面前，少女们将恐惧化作力量，尽各自的所能，目的只有一个，那就是活得更久，更快乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:01:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007sljJm7IQindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/xueyuangudao/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/xueyuangudao/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007nleOPcPMindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007LOxsH99jindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007bPkWU2gVindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007BQGsKG9Xindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/2024100762fW4bNiindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410076u5Dw48Xindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007ZRa6Rypfindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410072O0t9T4yindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/repl